# What a board leaves out is reported once, and again only when it changes (#303's review,
# M2): deleting a card on the whiteboard and undoing it save the board, "deleted" and
# "undone" stay their time, and nothing is reported after them. tests/drive.rs writes
# Ashfall.canvas: first in the file a card whose id is empty, which the engine doesn't take,
# then two cards above it.
size 160x44
env COLD_LAVA_EDITOR=none
wait-for example-workspace 35 notes
wait-for canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas: card 1 (id "") is left out
wait-gone canvas couldn't read Ashfall.canvas
wait-for ? help  q quit
wait 1000ms
expect-not couldn't read
keys w
wait-for whiteboards · type to filter · ⏎ open · Esc back
type ashfall
keys enter
wait-for whiteboard Ashfall · 3 cards · 0 arrows
keys tab
wait-for text card
keys d
wait-for whiteboard Ashfall · 2 cards · 0 arrows
expect deleted
wait 1500ms
expect deleted
wait-gone deleted
wait 1000ms
expect-not couldn't read
keys u
wait-for whiteboard Ashfall · 3 cards · 0 arrows
expect undone
wait 1500ms
expect undone
wait-gone undone
wait 1000ms
expect-not couldn't read
keys q
wait-for cold-lava workspaces
keys q
exits 0
